WEBVTT

00:04:26.371 --> 00:04:30.954
age, disability, LGBTQ status,

00:04:30.996 --> 00:04:32.704
even social class.

00:04:33.329 --> 00:04:36.204
So one study, for example,

00:04:36.204 --> 00:04:42.954
looked at callbacks offered to white men
with identical qualifications

00:04:42.996 --> 00:04:44.454
but different hobbies.

00:04:44.996 --> 00:04:49.829
One résumé listed things
like sailing and polo,

00:04:49.871 --> 00:04:52.829
and the other résumé listed things like

00:04:52.829 --> 00:04:56.663
counseling first-generation
college students

00:04:56.704 --> 00:04:57.954
and country music.

00:04:57.996 --> 00:05:01.079
And, if you can believe it, Mr. Polo --